# Webview (Last 100)

- Table columns: TIME, MODEL, COST, TOKENS, INPUT / OUTPUT, KIND. Newest first. Monospace body.
- Style with `--vscode-*` variables only. No hardcoded marketplace hex palettes.
- CSP nonce; `default-src 'none'`. No inline handlers without nonce.
- Host → webview: `{ type: 'data', events }`. Webview → host: `{ type: 'ready' }` | `{ type: 'close' }`.
- Payload must not include tokens, cookies, or emails beyond what PRD shows in the table.
- Keep JS small (vanilla). Do not add React.
